While this ability is active, you will continually call up to [1, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] level [1, 10, 25, 40, 50 (LVL 1-50)] shadows to aid you in battle. Each shadow costs 5 hate to summon. Shadows are weak combatants that can: Use Arcane Reconstruction to heal themselves (level [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)]), Blindside their opponents (level [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)]), and Phase Door from place to place.

Shadows ignore [5%, 31%, 52%, 69%, 85% (TL1-5)] of the damage dealt to them by their master.
